{"3646750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tooned Out Duo Dippin", "steam_appid": 3646750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Welcome To Tooned out Duo Dippin!!!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>This game is A Final Master Project from Legendary Mapper Silent Shadow.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>This game is an all out Fantasy arcade racing Simulation.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Try to beat all the cups in the Grand Prix in master mode if you Think you can drift.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Pick up weapons and blast your way to first place.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Dippin with two people on one kart or vehicle.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Play aggressively and take control of The game don't let it Control you.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Play in different Game Modes.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>You will smash your fingers and rage out trying to gain the lead.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Memorize the tracks and take advantage of the design.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Teleport through players objects and walls.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Teleport through the roof or beneath the Ground.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Instant reverse to regain Directional Control.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Change the soundtrack while Duo dippin. </u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Or hang out in the Juke box Mode and Vibe to the Soundtrack.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>This game is a body of work that has been painfully derived from years of suffering/studying  </u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Become A Monster Player! In this All Out Fantasy Arcade Racing heart pumping new franchise.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                               <strong><i><u>[Tooned Out Duo Dippin]</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist Now don't miss out!!!!!!!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Welcome To Tooned out Duo Dippin!!!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>This game is A Final Master Project from Legendary Mapper Silent Shadow.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>This game is an all out Fantasy arcade racing Simulation.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Try to beat all the cups in the Grand Prix in master mode if you Think you can drift.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Pick up weapons and blast your way to first place.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Dippin with two people on one kart or vehicle.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Play aggressively and take control of The game don't let it Control you.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Play in different Game Modes.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>You will smash your fingers and rage out trying to gain the lead.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Memorize the tracks and take advantage of the design.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Teleport through players objects and walls.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Teleport through the roof or beneath the Ground.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Instant reverse to regain Directional Control.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Change the soundtrack while Duo dippin. </u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Or hang out in the Juke box Mode and Vibe to the Soundtrack.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>This game is a body of